    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051112.0050\n\nTAIYUAN, Nov. 12 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nsustainable economy\n\n\n\n\nChinese Vice-Premier Zeng Peiyan urged China's major coal-producing province of Shanxi to turn its economy to a sustainable development track.\n\nDuring his inspection of the province from Thursday through Friday, Zeng expressed his appreciation of Shanxi's contribution to China's economic achievements and urged the province to develop a recycling economy.\n\nZeng stressed that Shanxi, which boasts rich resources and favourable industry infrastructure, should speed up industrial restructuring in accordance with the requirement of building a resource efficient and environment-friendly society.",
